  "scene_name": "My Room",
  "short_caption": "Small tiled bedroom with gaming desk, digital piano, and bed.",
  "literal_description": "A small square bedroom, about 3 m by 3 m, with white painted walls and beige square ceramic floor tiles. Desk wall: a light laminate desk stands in the corner next to the door wall, holding a laptop, curved monitor, mechanical keyboard, glowing mouse, two white gamepads, headphones, and a black speaker on a patterned mat, with a gray step platform beneath it; a large hand-painted poster of a yellow-haired anime character with Hebrew text and a smaller poster of a white-haired anime fighter in flames hang above. Right of the desk, a white digital piano keyboard sits on a black X stand in front of an aluminum casement window with a white roller shutter at the far end of the desk wall. Bed wall: a white mini fridge stands in the corner below the window, and a single bed with a navy cover and gray upholstered base runs along the adjacent wall with a light blue pillow at the fridge end and two small posters above; a reddish-brown wooden TV stand with a black flat-screen TV is at the other end of the bed. Opposite the desk: a black padded X-frame bench, a white pedestal fan, and an office chair with a black mesh back and white frame stand against the wall, with a rolled blue exercise mat, purple yoga blocks, black hex dumbbells, and a pile of clothes in the corner next to the door. Door wall: a wood-veneer door with a metal lever handle and a light switch, two black floating shelves of vinyl collectible figures and an anime figure, and a film poster with a pale face and blue sky. Black cables, power adapters, and a teal power strip lie on the floor between the desk and the keyboard stand.",
  "environment": "Small residential bedroom, roughly 3 m by 3 m, with white painted plaster walls, beige square ceramic floor tiles with a matching tile skirting strip, an aluminum-framed casement window with a white roller shutter, and a wood-veneer interior door.",
